---
import { examples } from '../lib/examples';
import type { Kind } from '../lib/examples';
interface Props { kind: Kind }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
const s=examples[kind];
---
<continuity-box data-kind={kind} class="box-explorer">
<div class="explorer-heading"><h3>{s.formula}</h3><span class="scope-label">定义域 {s.domain}</span></div>
<div class="plot-legend"><span class="legend-curve">函数曲线</span><span class="legend-sides">左右边界</span><span class="legend-limits">上下限制</span></div>
<div class="plot-host"><svg class="main-plot" role="img" aria-label={`${s.formula}，固定坐标系上的移动小框`}></svg></div>
<div class="view-caption"><span>固定坐标系 · 拖动中心，小框沿曲线移动</span><span data-view-scale></span></div>
<div class="explorer-controls">
<div class="position-control"><label>中心 x₀<input data-center type="number" step="any" value={s.center} aria-label="框中心的横坐标" /></label><div class="button-pair"><button data-move="-1">← 左移</button><button data-move="1">右移 →</button></div></div>
<div class="size-control"><div class="box-dimensions"><span>半高 ε = {s.eps}（固定）</span><span>半宽 δ = <strong data-delta>{s.delta}</strong></span></div>{kind!=='sine'&&<div class="button-pair"><button data-width=".5">收窄一半</button><button data-width="2">加宽一倍</button></div>}</div>
</div>
<div class="button-pair"><button data-camera="fit">查看中心附近</button><button data-camera="right">查看更右侧</button><button data-reset>重置</button></div>
<div class="explorer-status"><p data-status role="status"></p></div>
<p class="text-small" data-detail></p>
</continuity-box>
<script>import '../lib/continuity-element';</script>
